<section class="why">
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <span class="eyebrow">Why we exist</span>
            <h2>Every team automated<br />its own corner.</h2>
        </header>
        <div class="text">
            <p>
                Kestra started as an answer to a problem its founders had lived:
                every team in a company automating its own corner with its own
                tool, and nobody able to see the whole. Data had its scheduler,
                infrastructure its scripts, operations its runbooks. When
                something broke between them, no one owned it.
            </p>
            <p>
                We built one place where all of it runs, is versioned, and can
                be audited. The engine is Apache 2.0 and developed in public.
                Kestra Enterprise and Kestra Cloud fund that work, and bring the
                governance, scale and support that large organizations need.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

